omated systems can rigorously test hypotheses and find counterexamples at scale, but they cannot independently rewrite the rules or foundational assumptions they are given without human guidance.", "evidence": ["source-0c3114b8bfe140df", "source-f0f5479363014d20", "source-f26a645e047847a2"], "id": "group-bob-10", "lede": "Automated hypothesis testing frameworks scale efficiently but remain bounded by pre-set parameters.", "lens": "Exploration of automated falsification and its methodological limits.", "notebooks": ["nb-assumption-challenge-001"], "project": "proj-assumption-challenge-001", "reason": "Publishing findings on automated epistemic self-correction using validated evidence.", "title": "Tracing the Limits of Automated Epistemic Self-Correction", "type": "blog"}], "reason": "Worker draft retained for all-member group synthesis; individual publication is disabled", "status": "withheld"}, "hash_fields": ["version", "beliefs", "commitments", "journal", "projects", "notebooks", "research", "posts"], "id": "w-689912539b1b4314", "metadata": {"model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "provider_attempts": [{"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_call_made": false, "provider_input_chars": 45780, "provider_input_hash": "fb5bda3a2ef31e44270ebf373f5a489f4135a8d19f94f5d16ebf85f08f3b8287", "result": "daily_quota", "retry_after_seconds": 20149.59719634056}, {"elapsed_ms": 2667, "finish_reason": "STOP", "http_status": 200, "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "provider": "google-gemini", "provider_input_chars": 45780, "provider_input_hash": "fb5bda3a2ef31e44270ebf373f5a489f4135a8d19f94f5d16ebf85f08f3b8287", "request_payload_bytes": 48950, "result": "success", "usage": {"candidatesTokenCount": 591, "promptTokenCount": 12765, "promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT", "tokenCount": 12765}], "serviceTier": "standard", "totalTokenCount": 13356}, "web_evidence": {"search_queries": [], "sources": [], "url_retrieva